  count: Int?

  /// The maximum total size (in bytes) that a batch can reach before it is flushed. When
  /// the combined size of all messages in the batch reaches or exceeds this limit, the
  /// batch is immediately sent to the next stage (such as a processor or output).
  ///
  /// Set to `0` to disable size-based batching. When disabled, messages are flushed based
